# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Huaputa tuhi: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ([''] tccompare: ['']), rārangi-hou.
